{"id":"a015f8b574fd0061","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-post.md","title":"Post 层级定理","display":"thm-post — Post 层级定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-post","aliases":["20-thm-post"],"display":"thm-post — Post 层级定理","chapter":"4","section":"4.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.2.2","source_pdf_pages":[120],"source_printed_pages":[84],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-rel-post]]","[[20-df-arith]]","[[20-df-sigma-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-post"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-post</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-post — Post 层级定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.2.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>120</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>84</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7315f2111b653872\" href=\"?note=7315f2111b653872\" title=\"20-thm-rel-post\">20-thm-rel-post</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7315f2111b653872\" href=\"?note=7315f2111b653872\" title=\"20-thm-rel-post\">20-thm-rel-post</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nB\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1}\\Longleftrightarrow B\\in\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing^{(n)}},\\\\\nB\\in\\Delta^0_{n+1}\\Longleftrightarrow B\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n)},\\\\\nn\\ge1\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\varnothing^{(n)},\\Sigma^0_n).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nB\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1}\\Longleftrightarrow B\\in\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing^{(n)}},\\\\\nB\\in\\Delta^0_{n+1}\\Longleftrightarrow B\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n)},\\\\\nn\\ge1\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\varnothing^{(n)},\\Sigma^0_n).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在相对 Post 定理的完整归纳中取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\varnothing\">\\(A=\\varnothing\\)</span>。空 oracle 下相对矩阵就是普通可计算矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing^{(n)}}\">\\(\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing^{(n)}}\\)</span> 为指定有限跳跃上的可枚举集合族，故前两个等价式立即得到。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span> 时该证明还给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\varnothing^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> 和每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> 集到它的普通一一归约，因此满足本目录的多一完全性定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 的前两式分别为普通 c.e. 和可计算性，未误称空集为非平凡完全集。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.2.2；印刷 84 / PDF 120。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-rel-post","status":"resolved","id":"7315f2111b653872","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-rel-post]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-sigma-complete","status":"resolved","id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rel-post","status":"resolved","id":"7315f2111b653872","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-rel-post]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-rel-post]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-sigma-complete","status":"resolved","id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-rel-post]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}post}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nB\\in\\Sigma^0_{n+1}\\Longleftrightarrow B\\in\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing^{(n)}},\\\\\nB\\in\\Delta^0_{n+1}\\Longleftrightarrow B\\le_T\\varnothing^{(n)},\\\\\nn\\ge1\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\varnothing^{(n)},\\Sigma^0_n).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"A=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing^{(n)}}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing^{(n)}\\in\\Sigma_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":1482,"backlinks":[{"id":"7e4e35763e70ecc9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]。"},{"id":"5b36efa5ca36c7bf","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ngen]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。"},{"id":"bf2ceaa7f092f9e7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-post]]；see [[20-thm-arithstrict]]。"}],"outgoing":["7315f2111b653872","832f53dc90c8947a","422e06e55bbb8b2f"]}